  "description_short": "Garden café on Rosenhof Estate serving bistro fare amid flowers and countryside charm near George.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on the scenic Rosenhof Estate at Waboomskraal, La Rosa Blu Café offers a peaceful retreat from the bustle of George town. The setting combines a working florist with a relaxed bistro, so you can enjoy your meal surrounded by fresh blooms and rural views. It's a popular spot for leisurely breakfasts and light lunches, with both indoor seating and garden tables.\n\nThe menu leans towards café classics—think freshly baked pastries, seasonal salads, sandwiches, and daily specials that showcase local ingredients. Coffee is taken seriously here, and the homemade cakes are worth saving room for. The estate also hosts weddings and events, so the atmosphere can shift from quiet weekday mornings to lively weekend gatherings.\n\nWhether you're passing through on the Garden Route or looking for a tranquil lunch spot outside George, La Rosa Blu delivers honest food in a genuinely pretty setting. It's the kind of place where you linger a little longer than planned.",
